/-!
# A123226

Irregular triangle formed by coefficients of the polynomials p(k,x) = (x^k - Sum_{j=0..k-1} x^j )*p(k - 1, x), with p(0,x)=1, p(1,x)=x+1, read by rows.

The 63 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A123226

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 1, -1, -2, 0, 1, 1, 3, 3,
    0, -3, -1, 1, -1, -4, -7, -7, -2, 4,
    6, 3, -3, -2, 1, 1, 5, 12, 19, 21,
    15, 2, -11, -15, -10, -1, 7, 7, -2, -3,
